 "notes": [
  "New York Conference publishes its calendar as pictures (screenshots of an Apple-style calendar with a colour legend: Payroll, Office Closed, Camp Cherokee, Education, Conf Events, Youth director, Youth, Holidays, Union/NAD/Other, Women's Ministry). Each event's url is the image it was read from.",
  "Until about April 2026 the page used a Wix 'Google Event Calendar' widget; archived copies of the page do not contain the calendar data, so Oct 2025-Apr 2026 could not be recovered. The 'Conference Events' and 'Upcoming Youth Events' pages are stale (2024/2025 items).",
  "Payroll dates, office closures and public holidays were left out. One legend entry names a staff member; it is not used.",
  "Two youth-calendar titles and one Women's Ministry title are cut off in the images and are marked as truncated; nothing was guessed.",
  "The calendar is dominated by Camp Cherokee (summer camps, staff training, church retreats, outdoor schools) and youth/young-adult ministry (Compassion Sabbaths, two Jamaica mission trips, an 'At Home' mission trip in Utica, hiking, backpacking, youth weekends).",
  "Evangelism-specific events (public series, Bible-worker training) do not appear on the published May-Sep calendar; NYC's evangelism process is a church-initiated subsidy (see v47 research), which would not show on the conference calendar.",
  "AU Pathfinder Camporee is drawn as 12-17 May on the NYC image, while three other calendars give 28-31 May 2026; recorded as shown, with a note.",
  "Gleaner coverage in the window: NYC Nxt Gen Movement Dominican Republic mission trip (26 Jul-2 Aug 2025, before the window) and church relocations/renamings (Sep 2026, not an event)."
 ]
